; ad/Scenario3/data/inventory
; Provider-agnostic. Defines host groups and SSH defaults. No IPs, no dict_key —
; those come from the provider inventory (providers/vmware/inventory or
; providers/virtualbox/inventory), which is passed alongside this file via a
; second -i flag.
;
; RECONSTRUCTED this session: this file was not part of your upload (the file
; named "inventory" you supplied is actually providers/vmware/inventory —
; IPs/dict_key, no groups). Every topology play in ansible/scenario3/ targets
; a group defined here (routers, pcs, docker_nodes) — without this file those
; plays have nothing to match and silently run against zero hosts. Content
; below matches config.json's hosts exactly.

